# Local HAP signing materials (self-signed, local test only; NEVER commit private keys)
# 允许进库的只有说明文档与无密钥的 profile 明文，其余（p12/certs/p7b/logs/verify）全部忽略。
signing/*
!signing/README.md
!signing/profile/
signing/profile/*
!signing/profile/q207-profile.json

